{"title":"the board game of turkish bureaucracy","link":"https://keningzhu.com/journal/the-board-game-of-turkish-bureaucracy","date":1740902520000,"content":" \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/28f5a992-e1d2-4698-9121-b84114ed8dd5/diaries-2.28.25.jpg?format=1000w\" width=\"2048\" height=\"2048\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/28f5a992-e1d2-4698-9121-b84114ed8dd5/diaries-2.28.25.jpg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/28f5a992-e1d2-4698-9121-b84114ed8dd5/diaries-2.28.25.jpg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/28f5a992-e1d2-4698-9121-b84114ed8dd5/diaries-2.28.25.jpg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/28f5a992-e1d2-4698-9121-b84114ed8dd5/diaries-2.28.25.jpg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/28f5a992-e1d2-4698-9121-b84114ed8dd5/diaries-2.28.25.jpg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/28f5a992-e1d2-4698-9121-b84114ed8dd5/diaries-2.28.25.jpg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/28f5a992-e1d2-4698-9121-b84114ed8dd5/diaries-2.28.25.jpg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  <p><em>this is my </em><a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/visual-diaries\"><em>visual diaries,</em></a><em> in which I synthesize my week through my hands, and inner vision.</em></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n<hr /> \n\n\n  <p><strong><em>the game:</em></strong><em> renew your residency permit in as FEW steps as possible. minus points for falling on slippery hills, getting your shoes wet, losing your temper, hating humanity, or catching a cold. plus points for speed and getting home fast. </em></p><p></p><p><em>-</em><br /><br />this is what we did to renew my turkish residency permit. I made this bright, colorful because the experience itself was ANYTHING but that. it was seven layers of bureaucratic hell; a recursive Kafka-esque experience that required three trips on two separate days. it was a literal manifestation of Five of Pentacles (in which two figures are hunched and walking through a blizzard, looking very cold). my partner K and I were both very, very cold — we carried no umbrellas, and wore the wrong shoes for an unexpectedly snowy week in Istanbul (our first in three years). afterwards, I did absolutely nothing with the rest of my day except lie like a vegetable on the couch. I’m so grateful to have K — who holds my hand up until the security line (block #13), and then, all the way home, so that I can pretend to be a rag doll and try not to experience the sensory assault that is traveling through Istanbul public transit.   <br /><br />the <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/visual-art\">visual medium</a> is my way of digesting life with my inner eye — or in this case, making an unpleasant experience more pleasant in my mind, so that in 6 months (when I have to do it all over again, damn it). I can pretend I’m just playing this board game again. <br /><br />many years ago, while living in berlin, I was on the phone with german bureaucracy and <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/german-bureaucracy-turkish-figs\" target=\"_blank\">drawing turkish figs</a>. it’s funny that now I’m in the very different experience of turkish bureaucracy. which feels… way less scary, way more baffling, way more athletic (mostly cause of the hills and recursive looping?!) <br /><br /></p><h1>the recursive paths we took</h1><p>after waiting over an hour for my appointment in a crowded room where women kept speaking to me in uzbek or russian, they still required unlisted additional documents, which meant going to the post office, the printers, sitting in an strangely touristy looking ottoman cafe shivering, only to be told to come back on Monday at 8am and repeat the whole thing again, which we did. </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d97b46a3-a308-4ec5-aa14-cf6c53855985/diaries-2.28.25-path.jpg?format=1000w\" width=\"2048\" height=\"2048\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d97b46a3-a308-4ec5-aa14-cf6c53855985/diaries-2.28.25-path.jpg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d97b46a3-a308-4ec5-aa14-cf6c53855985/diaries-2.28.25-path.jpg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d97b46a3-a308-4ec5-aa14-cf6c53855985/diaries-2.28.25-path.jpg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d97b46a3-a308-4ec5-aa14-cf6c53855985/diaries-2.28.25-path.jpg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d97b46a3-a308-4ec5-aa14-cf6c53855985/diaries-2.28.25-path.jpg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d97b46a3-a308-4ec5-aa14-cf6c53855985/diaries-2.28.25-path.jpg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d97b46a3-a308-4ec5-aa14-cf6c53855985/diaries-2.28.25-path.jpg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  <h1>the first sketch</h1><p>laying out the elements </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/bd987260-4dfb-4b60-8d34-cb090a8fb625/diaries-2.28.25-sketch.jpg?format=1000w\" width=\"2048\" height=\"2048\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/bd987260-4dfb-4b60-8d34-cb090a8fb625/diaries-2.28.25-sketch.jpg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/bd987260-4dfb-4b60-8d34-cb090a8fb625/diaries-2.28.25-sketch.jpg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/bd987260-4dfb-4b60-8d34-cb090a8fb625/diaries-2.28.25-sketch.jpg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/bd987260-4dfb-4b60-8d34-cb090a8fb625/diaries-2.28.25-sketch.jpg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/bd987260-4dfb-4b60-8d34-cb090a8fb625/diaries-2.28.25-sketch.jpg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/bd987260-4dfb-4b60-8d34-cb090a8fb625/diaries-2.28.25-sketch.jpg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/bd987260-4dfb-4b60-8d34-cb090a8fb625/diaries-2.28.25-sketch.jpg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  <h1>notes on process</h1><p><br />before I started this, I knew that I wanted some kind of board game structure, and it took me a while to decide on a grid (as opposed to all the infinite other possible shapes). the act of mapping out locations and places felt tedious, but not un-fun. </p><p>I definitely had to make decisions around <em>how much</em> detail I would give each tiny square, and drawing in tight, monolined detailed proportions isn’t my preferred mode these days. I got super bored and lazy with drawing public transit and cars, hence I opted for movement over detail.  </p><p>so, instead, this felt more like a study on color, movement, block structure and form — and could one day inspire more board-game-esque designs or even web apps. </p><p>it’s not about a specific component, block, detail, or part, but the system as a whole. </p><p>I drew the bulk of this while listening to the audiobook, <a href=\"https://sirenscallbook.com/\" target=\"_blank\">“the siren’s call” by Chris Hayes</a></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/165b45b8-803b-4625-a325-3608e11c4a12/diaries-2.11.25-video-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?format=1000w\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/165b45b8-803b-4625-a325-3608e11c4a12/diaries-2.11.25-video-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/165b45b8-803b-4625-a325-3608e11c4a12/diaries-2.11.25-video-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/165b45b8-803b-4625-a325-3608e11c4a12/diaries-2.11.25-video-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/165b45b8-803b-4625-a325-3608e11c4a12/diaries-2.11.25-video-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/165b45b8-803b-4625-a325-3608e11c4a12/diaries-2.11.25-video-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/165b45b8-803b-4625-a325-3608e11c4a12/diaries-2.11.25-video-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/165b45b8-803b-4625-a325-3608e11c4a12/diaries-2.11.25-video-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n<hr />  \n\n\n  <p>sign up for my <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/letters\">newsletter</a><br />more <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/tag/weekly+diaries\" target=\"_blank\">visual diaries</a><br />more <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/visual-art\" target=\"_blank\">visual art</a><br /></p>","author":"Kening Zhu","siteTitle":"kening zhu","siteHash":"ef8a94b9fc20c32a4ee7d94ee971337d278e8b2fafe747123e4eb5cea026e84e","entryHash":"da21da8bb0829dd1c81925dce657849af4d3408f05779f36a220feb8b6debd39","category":"Sites"}